!Name: Infinite glider hotel
!Author: David Bell
!A pattern in which two pairs of Corderships recede and allow more and
!more gliders to bounce back and forth between them. Created on October 9, 1992.
!www.conwaylife.com/wiki/index.php?title=Infinite_glider_hotel
